# IDP Estate Installer

This package installs the IDP Estate bootstrap tools and services.

## What's installed

- **idp-install-all** — One-shot estate bootstrap script at `/usr/local/bin/`
- **ai.estate.fleetview-backend** — Launchd agent for the FleetView voice backend

## After installation

Run the full bootstrap from Terminal:

    /usr/local/bin/idp-install-all

This installs Python 3.12 (via MacPorts), all Python packages, and
configures the launchd agents.

FleetView backend runs at: http://127.0.0.1:18790

## More information

See: https://github.com/chidionyema/idp
